# N is chosen using n.  That is not a hard problem to fix -- it is
# impossible, and the indentation shows why: there is no n to the left,
# only below, and the line below opens a narrower scope.

sequence a(n) = 1 / n
claim a(n) -> 0

proof:
    for every eps, where eps > 0
        there is N = floor(n / 2)
            for every n, where n > N
                abs(a(n) - 0) < eps
end
